  "comments": "Jo nang pa scholar. After studying with Dol po pa (ID:4213) he went back to Mi nyag and built the monastery of Nges don gyi chos gzhi dgon sde.  ([UNV7NRZ8]: 84).\r\n\r\nIt is not certain whether he is the same person as the \"blo gros grags pa\" mentioned in the biography of rMa se ston pa Rin chen bzang po (ID:6363), another student of Dol po po who founded rA tI monastery (this is plausible, as Blo gros grags pa was a student of Ye shes rdo rje, who was a student of rMa se ston pa).",
